      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds okay but i'm worried \"minor administrative item\" might make them ask too many follow up questions. if they start digging into what the \"item\" is, they might realize it's a serious clerical error and pull the trigger on the penalty. \n\nis there a way to just say everything is moving through customs normally? like, can we just tell them it's all clear and we're just in the final stages of transit? we need to be 100% sure they don't suspect any actual delay.",
